y seized Ukraine and Crimea and founded cities such as Sebastopol, defining the Russian empire to this day. Their affair was so tumultuous they negotiated an arrangement to share power, leaving Potemkin free to love his beautiful nieces, Catherine her young male favourites. But these 'twin souls' never stopped loving each other. Drawing on their intimate letters and vast new research from St Petersburg to Odessa, Simon Sebag Montefiore's enthralling, much-acclaimed biography restores these imperial partners to their rightful place as titans of their age.","pageCount":634,"publicationYear":2001,"subjectCategories":[{"source":"google_books","scheme":"google_books_category","label":"Favorites, Royal","sourceId":"source-google-books-summary-prince-of-princes-the-life-of-potemkin-simon-sebag-montefiore"}],"displaySummary":"It is on their intimate letters and vast new research from St Petersburg to Odessa, Simon Sebag Montefiore's enthralling, much-acclaimed biography restores these imperial partners to their rightful place as titans of their age.","primaryTopic":"Presidential Biography","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"Biography","confidence":"medium","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"Biography","score":8,"evidenceCount":1}],"evidence":[{"source":"llm_classifier","rawLabel":"Biography","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":8,"confidence":"high","note":"The book focuses primarily on the life of Potemkin, categorizing it as a biography, while also addressing historical contexts.","id":"subject-evidence-book-prince-of-princes-the-life-of-potemkin-simon-sebag-montefiore-1"},{"source":"keyword_classifier","rawLabel":"Biography","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":2,"confidence":"low","note":"biography/title pattern; world history keyword; history keyword or history prize; gender/sexuality keyword; travel/place keyword","id":"subject-evidence-book-prince-of-princes-the-life-of-potemkin-simon-sebag-montefiore-3"},{"source":"topic_classifier","rawLabel":"Pres